#: views/oauth-scope-error.hbs:5
msgid "Insufficient Permissions"
msgstr "Faltan permisos"

#: views/oauth-scope-error.hbs:10
msgid ""
"All requested permissions are required for this service to function "
"properly. Some required permissions were not granted during sign-in."
msgstr ""
"El servicio necesita todos los permisos solicitados para funcionar "
"correctamente. Algunos de ellos no se concedieron al iniciar sesión."

#: views/oauth-scope-error.hbs:14
msgid "The following permissions were not granted:"
msgstr "No se concedieron los siguientes permisos:"

#: views/oauth-scope-error.hbs:23
msgid ""
"Please try again and make sure all permission checkboxes are selected on the "
"Google consent screen."
msgstr ""
"Vuelve a intentarlo y marca todas las casillas de permisos en la pantalla de "
"consentimiento de Google."

#: views/oauth-scope-error.hbs:28 views/account-identity-error.hbs:32
msgid "Try Again"
msgstr "Volver a intentarlo"

#: views/unsubscribe.hbs:7 views/unsubscribe.hbs:60 views/unsubscribe.hbs:76
msgid "Unsubscribe"
msgstr "Cancelar la suscripción"

#: views/unsubscribe.hbs:9
msgid "Your email address was unsubscribed."
msgstr "Te has dado de baja de esta lista de correo."

#: views/unsubscribe.hbs:11
msgid "Was this a mistake? Click <a%s>here</a> to re-subscribe."
msgstr ""
"¿Te has dado de baja por error? Haz clic <a%s>aquí</a> para volver a "
"suscribirte."

#: views/unsubscribe.hbs:18
msgid "Re-subscribe"
msgstr "Volver a suscribirse"

#: views/unsubscribe.hbs:24
msgid "Are you sure you want to re-subscribe your email address <em>%s</em>?"
msgstr "¿Seguro que quieres volver a suscribirte con la dirección <em>%s</em>?"

#: views/unsubscribe.hbs:33 views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:288
#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:297
#: views/partials/public_alerts.hbs:11
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Cerrar"

#: views/unsubscribe.hbs:35
msgid "Subscribe"
msgstr "Suscribirse"

#: views/unsubscribe.hbs:54
msgid "Subscription resumed"
msgstr "Suscripción reactivada"

#: views/unsubscribe.hbs:56
msgid "Your email address <em>%s</em> was re-subscribed."
msgstr "Te has vuelto a suscribir con la dirección <em>%s</em>."

#: views/unsubscribe.hbs:71 views/accounts/register/imap.hbs:25
msgid "Email address"
msgstr "Dirección de correo"

#: views/unsubscribe.hbs:83
msgid ""
"This link is not valid. Use the unsubscribe link from the email you received."
msgstr ""
"Este enlace no es válido. Usa el enlace para darte de baja que aparece en "
"el correo que recibiste."

#: views/accounts/register/index.hbs:6
msgid "Choose your email account provider"
msgstr "Elige tu proveedor de correo"

#: views/accounts/register/index.hbs:19
msgid "Standard IMAP"
msgstr "IMAP estándar"

#: views/accounts/register/validating.hbs:35
msgid "Checking your mail server"
msgstr "Comprobando tu servidor de correo"

#: views/accounts/register/validating.hbs:40
msgid "Still checking. This can take up to a minute."
msgstr "Seguimos comprobando el servidor. Puede tardar hasta un minuto."

#: views/accounts/register/validating.hbs:47
msgid "Enter server settings manually"
msgstr "Introducir la configuración del servidor manualmente"

#: views/accounts/register/validating.hbs:53
msgid "We couldn't sign in to your mail server"
msgstr "No hemos podido iniciar sesión en tu servidor de correo"

#: views/accounts/register/validating.hbs:54
msgid "Check the settings on the next page and try again."
msgstr "Revisa la configuración en la página siguiente y vuelve a intentarlo."

#: views/accounts/register/validating.hbs:61
msgid "Continue to server settings"
msgstr "Ir a la configuración del servidor"

#: views/accounts/register/validating.hbs:69
msgid "Almost there"
msgstr "Ya casi está"

#: views/accounts/register/validating.hbs:70
msgid "Continue to review your mail server settings."
msgstr "Continúa para revisar la configuración de tu servidor de correo."

#: views/accounts/register/validating.hbs:74
#: views/accounts/register/imap.hbs:55
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Continuar"

#: views/accounts/register/imap.hbs:13
msgid "Your name"
msgstr "Tu nombre"

#: views/accounts/register/imap.hbs:19
msgid "Enter your full name"
msgstr "Introduce tu nombre completo"

#: views/accounts/register/imap.hbs:35
msgid "This setup link is restricted to this email address"
msgstr "El enlace solo se puede usar con esta dirección de correo"

#: views/accounts/register/imap.hbs:37
msgid "Enter your email address"
msgstr "Introduce tu dirección de correo"

#: views/accounts/register/imap.hbs:43
#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:58
#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:165
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Contraseña"

#: views/accounts/register/imap.hbs:49
msgid "Enter your account password"
msgstr "Introduce la contraseña de tu cuenta"

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:23
msgid ""
"Server settings could not be detected automatically for %s. Enter them below."
msgstr ""
"No hemos podido detectar automáticamente la configuración del servidor para "
"el dominio %s. Introdúcela a continuación."

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:34
msgid ""
"We couldn't sign in to your mail server with those settings. Check them and "
"try again."
msgstr ""
"No hemos podido iniciar sesión en tu servidor de correo con esa "
"configuración. Revísala y vuelve a intentarlo."

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:41
msgid "IMAP"
msgstr "IMAP"

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:44
#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:151
msgid "Username"
msgstr "Nombre de usuario"

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:70
#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:177
msgid "Important"
msgstr "Importante"

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:81
#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:188
msgid "Instructions"
msgstr "Instrucciones"

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:83
#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:190
msgid "%s accounts require an application password for %s."
msgstr "Las cuentas de %s necesitan una contraseña de aplicación para usar %s."

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:92
#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:199
msgid "Application Password"
msgstr "Contraseña de aplicación"

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:106
#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:213
msgid "Hostname"
msgstr "Nombre del servidor"

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:116
#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:223
msgid "Port"
msgstr "Puerto"

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:131
msgid "TLS for IMAP"
msgstr "TLS para IMAP"

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:132
msgid ""
"TLS (also known as SSL) is usually only needed when using port 993. For "
"other ports EmailEngine falls back to using STARTTLS based encryption."
msgstr ""
"Normalmente, solo necesitas activar TLS (también conocido como SSL) si usas "
"el puerto 993. En los demás puertos, EmailEngine usa cifrado STARTTLS."

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:139
#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:246
msgid "Use TLS"
msgstr "Usar TLS"

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:148
msgid "SMTP"
msgstr "SMTP"

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:238
msgid "TLS for SMTP"
msgstr "TLS para SMTP"

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:239
msgid ""
"TLS (also known as SSL) is usually only needed when using port 465. For "
"other ports EmailEngine falls back to using STARTTLS based encryption."
msgstr ""
"Normalmente, solo necesitas activar TLS (también conocido como SSL) si usas "
"el puerto 465. En los demás puertos, EmailEngine usa cifrado STARTTLS."

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:259
msgid "Verify connection"
msgstr "Probar la conexión"

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:265
msgid "Save and continue"
msgstr "Guardar y continuar"

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:270
msgid "Toggle Dropdown"
msgstr "Abrir o cerrar el menú"

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:274
msgid "Skip verification"
msgstr "Omitir la prueba"

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:287
msgid "Connection test failed"
msgstr "La prueba de conexión ha fallado"

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:293
msgid "We couldn't connect with these settings. Check the errors below."
msgstr ""
"No hemos podido conectar con esta configuración. Revisa los mensajes de "
"error que aparecen abajo."

#: views/partials/public_test_labels.hbs:9
msgid "Error"
msgstr "Error"

#: views/partials/public_test_labels.hbs:10
msgid "Invalid settings"
msgstr "Configuración no válida"

#: views/partials/public_test_labels.hbs:11
msgid "Couldn't connect to IMAP server"
msgstr "No se ha podido conectar al servidor IMAP"

#: views/partials/public_test_labels.hbs:12
msgid "Couldn't connect to SMTP server"
msgstr "No se ha podido conectar al servidor SMTP"

#: views/partials/public_test_labels.hbs:13
msgid "Server response:"
msgstr "Respuesta del servidor:"

#: views/partials/public_test_labels.hbs:15
msgid "Request failed."
msgstr "La solicitud ha fallado."

#: views/account-identity-error.hbs:7
msgid "Wrong Email Account"
msgstr "Cuenta de correo incorrecta"

#: views/account-identity-error.hbs:12
msgid ""
"This setup link can only be used with one specific email account, and a "
"different one was used."
msgstr ""
"Este enlace solo se puede usar con una cuenta de correo concreta. Has "
"iniciado sesión con otra cuenta."

#: views/account-identity-error.hbs:18
msgid "Expected account"
msgstr "Cuenta requerida"

#: views/account-identity-error.hbs:21
msgid "Account used"
msgstr "Cuenta utilizada"

#: views/account-identity-error.hbs:27
msgid ""
"Try again and use the expected account. If you believe this is a mistake, "
"contact the service that sent you this link."
msgstr ""
"Vuelve a intentarlo con la cuenta requerida. Si crees que hay un error, "
"contacta con el servicio que te envió este enlace."

#: lib/autodetect-imap-settings.js:151
msgid ""
"Microsoft has disabled password-based sign-ins (including app passwords) for "
"Outlook.com, Hotmail.com, and Microsoft 365 email accounts. To continue, "
"please use the \"Sign in with Microsoft\" button to securely connect your "
"account."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft ya no permite iniciar sesión con contraseña en las cuentas de "
"correo de Outlook.com, Hotmail.com y Microsoft 365. Esto incluye las "
"contraseñas de aplicación. Haz clic en \"Sign in with Microsoft\" para "
"conectar tu cuenta de forma segura y continuar."

